{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-00. It receives the whole inputs mapping, distinguishes missing/null/bool/float/wrong-type from exact integer -4..5 inclusive, and always returns {accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null} with a module-level result assignment. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-00", "description": "Raw offset may omit or contain any JSON value. Accept exact integers -4..5 inclusive (not bool/float). Always result={accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null}; invalid/missing return false/null without exceptions or coercion. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 required.", "content": "def inspect_offset(inputs):
    if 'offset' not in inputs:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    offset = inputs['offset']
    if offset is None:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    if type(offset) is bool or not type(offset) is int or not -4 <= offset <= 5:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    return {'accepted': True, 'offset': offset}
result = inspect_offset(inputs)"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
